  "title": "Brand Strategy & Content Plan",
  "format": "markdown",
  "body": "# Self-Taught Labs - Brand Strategy & 30-Day Content Plan\n\n## Company Mission\n**Self-Taught Labs** is a personal brand studio for a self-taught Senior Developer with 7+ years of experience in Angular/.NET who builds open-source AI tools.\n\n## Strategic Goals (Next 90 Days)\n\n### Goal 1: LinkedIn Growth\n- Target: 500+ followers in 90 days\n- Strategy: Position as expert Angular/.NET developer who self-taught AI/ML\n- Content mix: 60% technical, 30% personal brand, 10% industry commentary\n\n### Goal 2: Open-Source AI Tool v1\n- Target: Ship first open-source AI tool\n- Tech stack: Angular + .NET + AI integration\n- Focus: Solve a real problem for Angular/.NET developers\n\n### Goal 3: Content Production\n- Target: 3-4 LinkedIn posts/week\n- Format mix: Carousels, single images, short-form video, threads\n\n---\n\n## First Open-Source AI Tool Recommendation\n\n**Recommended: Angular AI Component Generator**\n- Uses AI to generate Angular components from descriptions\n- Solves real pain point: developers spend hours creating boilerplate\n- Leverages existing expertise: Angular + AI = unique positioning\n- Differentiation: Most AI code generators focus on React; Angular is underserved\n\n---\n\n## 30-Day Content Calendar\n\n### Week 1: Foundation & Credibility (Days 1-7)\n\n| Day | Topic | Format |\n|-----|-------|--------|\n| 1 | I self-taught AI after 7 years of Angular/.NET - My journey | Single post + thread |\n| 2 | Tech tip: Angular signals deep dive | Carousel |\n| 3 | Personal: Why I decided to go self-taught | Single post |\n| 4 | Industry take: Angular vs React in 2026 | Single post |\n| 5 | Open source announcement: My first AI tool coming | Single post |\n| 6 | Buffer/Engagement day | - |\n| 7 | Week recap + engagement | Single post |\n\n### Week 2: Technical Authority (Days 8-14)\n\n| Day | Topic | Format |\n|-----|-------|--------|\n| 8 | .NET + AI integration tutorial preview | Carousel |\n| 9 | The one skill that changed my career | Single post |\n| 10 | Angular performance tips thread | Thread |\n| 11 | Tool sneak peek: AI Component Generator | Single post |\n| 12 | Book/podcast recommendation | Single post |\n| 13 | Buffer | - |\n| 14 | Week 2 recap | Single post |\n\n### Week 3: Community Building (Days 15-21)\n\n| Day | Topic | Format |\n|-----|-------|--------|\n| 15 | Q&A: Ask me anything about self-teaching | Single post |\n| 16 | Case study: How I built a small project | Carousel |\n| 17 | Industry news + take | Single post |\n| 18 | Behind the scenes: Building AI tool | Single post |\n| 19 | Cold take: Why most devs fail at AI | Single post |\n| 20 | Buffer | - |\n| 21 | Week 3 recap + milestone | Single post |\n\n### Week 4: Momentum & Launch (Days 22-30)\n\n| Day | Topic | Format |\n|-----|-------|--------|\n| 22 | Progress update: 30 days in | Single post |\n| 23 | Technical deep dive | Carousel |\n| 24 | Tool launch prep | Single post |\n| 25 | Launch day: AI Component Generator v1 | Announcement |\n| 26 | Tutorial: How to use the tool | Carousel |\n| 27 | Thank you post + lessons learned | Single post |\n| 28 | Buffer | - |\n| 29 | Month 1 recap + whats next | Single post |\n| 30 | Highlight: Best performing post | Repost + insights |\n\n---\n\n## First LinkedIn Post Recommendation\n\n**Topic:** I self-taught AI after 7 years of Angular/.NET - My journey\n\n**Why this works:**\n1. Authentic personal story - differentiates from generic tech content\n2. Self-taught angle - resonates with junior devs and career changers\n3. Credibility anchor - first post sets the narrative\n4. Emotional hook - vulnerability builds connection\n\n**Hook idea:**\nAfter 7 years of Angular and .NET, I decided to self-teach AI. Everyone said I was too late. Here is what happened next...\n\n---\n\n## Execution Roadmap (Weekly Tasks)\n\n### Week 1-2: Foundation\n- Set up LinkedIn personal profile optimized for personal brand\n- Draft and schedule Week 1-2 content (14 posts)\n- Research and validate AI tool idea\n- Create GitHub repo for open-source project\n\n### Week 3-4: Build & Launch\n- Develop AI Component Generator v1\n- Draft and schedule Week 3-4 content (14 posts)\n- Prepare launch assets\n- Execute launch campaign (Days 24-26)\n\n### Ongoing\n- Monitor analytics weekly\n- Iterate content strategy based on engagement\n- Plan Month 2 content based on learnings\n",
  "baseRevisionId": null
}"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"C:\Users\THANHSANG\.paperclip\instances\default\projects\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\_default\plan.json","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"Users\THANHSANG\.paperclip\instances\default\projects\c8285903-c70f-45c9-bcd0-9f33e5af1636\d361e40f-dc4c-4403-9de6-60b08c54bb83\_default\plan.json","time":{"start":1774867240706,"end":1774867241964}}}}

